{"title":"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 15","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_15\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 15</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_15\">Problem 15</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 15\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/a/fda620cbd703f6afcca3c84db4ec1ad7a9214aa1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin{2x}\\sin{3x}=\\cos{2x}\\cos{3x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"216\" height=\"14\" />, then one value for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/2/3728fb7274879c3846d0be089a487838b1f7e237.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A) \\ }18^\\circ \\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ }30^\\circ \\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\ } 36^\\circ \\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\ }45^\\circ \\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\ } 60^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"424\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We divide both sides of the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Equation\" title=\"Equation\">equation</a> by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/b/6ab8512af8e3574915a21801e949c4e0f5bd8e11.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cos{2x}\\times\\cos{3x}$\" width=\"115\" height=\"12\" /> to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/0/880e1e4daa243e01bb07d6390e6ec8877baa4cb7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\sin{2x}\\times\\sin{3x}}{\\cos{2x}\\times\\cos{3x}}=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"152\" height=\"37\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/e/77eacac127c3540763d27bb65fdd08f1648ca234.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tan{2x}\\times\\tan{3x}=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"152\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p><p>This looks a lot like the formula relating the slopes of two <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Perpendicular\" title=\"Perpendicular\">perpendicular</a> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Line\" title=\"Line\">lines</a>, which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/4/eb40beaab2c3b17612b8f859440ec2ad817e083f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m_1\\times m_2=-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"115\" height=\"14\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/d/25d659c8074c617549d61db9db0773e0fccad7b3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"21\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/5/ee54e8432d4a60984309e86f32931b04c8e2f1da.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"22\" height=\"10\" /> are the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Slope\" title=\"Slope\">slopes</a>. It's made even more relatable by the fact that the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Tangent\" title=\"Tangent\">tangent</a> of an <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Angle\" title=\"Angle\">angle</a> can be defined by the slope of the line that makes that angle with the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=X-axis\" title=\"X-axis\">x-axis</a>.\n</p><p>We can make this look even more like the slope formula by multiplying both sides by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/e/bae5aba07d37ff6ff813107e76260fb31ad5794e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" />:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/b/a5b69693ad99094d66f78670fc0db21e44d8712f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tan{2x}\\times-\\tan{3x}=-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"186\" height=\"15\" />, and using the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Trigonometric_identity\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Trigonometric identity\">trigonometric identity</a> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/8/b58e89d43afb324ab89bb536b42e744e620aa9a5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-\\tan{x}=\\tan{-x}$\" width=\"134\" height=\"11\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/9/329969b214b2208deffdc5ae7e513a575db08503.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tan{2x}\\times\\tan{-3x}=-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"180\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p><p>Now it's time for a diagram:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/b/11b9ff390cf7e46c0808236853eff3ea2d825906.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] unitsize(2.54cm); draw(unitcircle); draw((0,-1.25)--(0,1.25)); draw((-1.25,0)--(1.25,0)); draw((0,0)--(cos(2pi/10),sin(2pi/10))); draw((0,0)--(cos(-3pi/10),sin(-3pi/10))); label(&quot;$\\tan{-3x}$&quot;,(cos(-3pi/10),sin(-3pi/10)),SE); label(&quot;$\\tan{2x}$&quot;,(cos(2pi/10),sin(2pi/10)),NE); label(&quot;$2x$&quot;,(.125,.03),ENE); label(&quot;$3x$&quot;,(.125,-.06),ESE); [/asy]\" width=\"308\" height=\"302\" />\nSince the product of the two slopes, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/3/6230434bb12cc1fff85f197be34a5105296026be.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tan{2x}$\" width=\"48\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/4/6944a57fabddfae3cd73c635e3d77ea5ca66efe9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tan{-3x}$\" width=\"62\" height=\"12\" />, is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/e/bae5aba07d37ff6ff813107e76260fb31ad5794e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" />, the lines are perpendicular, and the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Angle\" title=\"Angle\">angle</a> between them is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/e/aeebb746f8c0d3dac5219c3635617032430afee9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\pi}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"17\" height=\"34\" />. The angle between them is also <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/1/5612f5ba253e3a4027ba02ab8311dc0d1e377d3b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x+3x=5x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"104\" height=\"14\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/7/9e701c7aaf24fb744b27cdbc6b9befa60450fccc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5x=\\frac{\\pi}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"57\" height=\"33\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/7/377da4de6753d94d21289693d0eb508a9709e477.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=\\frac{\\pi}{10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"55\" height=\"33\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/7/1572dd71dedb60dac3f7da3fcf3f0bd6e2d073ad.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$18^\\circ, \\boxed{\\text{A}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"58\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p><p>NOTE: To show that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/b/0cbd9463f1635d4eaa092662987d5a67db5d2622.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$18^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"24\" height=\"13\" /> is not the only solution, we can also set <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/e/87e9f9eb8f39820b3b8cd2c4b06e10d90e0d3b44.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5x$\" width=\"19\" height=\"12\" /> equal to another angle measure congruent to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/e/aeebb746f8c0d3dac5219c3635617032430afee9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\pi}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"17\" height=\"34\" />, such as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/a/8ea301a5d6e7b1c82f3c38c5f389fcaed97775bc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{5\\pi}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"22\" height=\"37\" />, yielding another solution as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/8/128c9406ecb36d5cb4bc90bc1a3dd97c3d1e9cb1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\pi}{2}=90^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"63\" height=\"33\" />, which clearly is a solution to the equation.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can simply try the answers. We quickly see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/b/0cbd9463f1635d4eaa092662987d5a67db5d2622.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$18^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"24\" height=\"13\" /> works, since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/e/47e5d56c6278e0201df2e656c8de4b3943a257f2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin(36^\\circ)\\sin(54^\\circ)=\\cos(54^\\circ)\\cos(36^\\circ)=\\cos(36^\\circ)\\cos(54^\\circ)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"438\" height=\"18\" /> by the identity <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/a/a0a01c6c4b64da1a695281c30249237e001b32c0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cos(x)=\\sin(90^\\circ-x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"170\" height=\"20\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Start by subtracting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/8/958a6c3397714275ee5c0f9479b0dc70a9d69dfb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin{2x}\\sin{3x}$\" width=\"92\" height=\"12\" /> from both sides to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/b/1db383a6c9b8c843cabe2f5eb234eef7fea16669.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cos{2x}\\cos{3x}-\\sin{2x}\\sin{3x}=0$\" width=\"244\" height=\"12\" />. We recognize that this is of the form <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/3/613f2107bcac1f26e63943fe62d4f44154fa9164.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cos{a}\\cos{b}-\\sin{a}\\sin{b}=\\cos{(a+b)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"272\" height=\"18\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/f/0bfccb8aac5252ec587800e86fc1ce9c772d8797.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cos{2x}\\cos{3x}-\\sin{2x}\\sin{3x}=\\cos{(2x+3x)}=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"371\" height=\"18\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/6/676dfb3ed90409d6914cf1b4a381504fd269044d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cos{90^\\circ}=0$\" width=\"86\" height=\"13\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/3/ee34b307c54d4874ce240188afe60ceed9a27cc1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=\\boxed{18^\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"72\" height=\"24\" />.\n</p><p>~purplepenguin2\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME\" title=\"1984 AHSME\">1984 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1984 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1984\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">Problem 14</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">Problem 16</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 25\">25</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 26\">26</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 27\">27</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 28\">28</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 29\">29</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 30\">30</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AHSME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AHSME Problems and Solutions\"> All AHSME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017160252\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.041 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.062 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 263/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2494/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 152/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 7107/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   12.872      1 -total\n 59.42%    7.649      1 Template:AHSME_box\n 38.81%    4.996      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:9719:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017160252 and revision id 155234. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}